# Third-party notices

Klass8s continues three open-source projects published under the MIT License:

- `dealroadshow/k8s-framework` — https://github.com/petr-buchin/k8s-framework
- `dealroadshow/k8s-bundle` — https://github.com/petr-buchin/k8s-bundle
- `dealroadshow/keda-bundle` — the KEDA autoscaling integration

Klass8s merged the framework, its Symfony bundle and the KEDA bundle into one package, renamed it
and extended it. The portions that come from those projects remain under the MIT License. Its
notice follows exactly as `k8s-framework` and `k8s-bundle` publish it; `keda-bundle` declared the
MIT License in its `composer.json` and shipped no license file of its own, and the same publisher's
notice covers it.

